Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/dbs/xtiff/xtiff.c
Line: 999
Function: CreateXImage
Bug type: double-free
CWE: CWE-415
Explanation: XDestroyImage(xImage) frees both the XImage structure and its data buffer (xImage->data), which was set to imageMemory in XCreateImage. The subsequent free(imageMemory) frees the same pointer again, causing a double free when appData.usePixmap is True.

